  "description": "A spacious one bedroom apartment located in the heart of the city with a secure underground car space.\n\nSavills is delighted to present this exceptional one-bedroom first-floor apartment, ideally positioned on the ever-popular Bachelors Walk development in the heart of Dublin 1.\n\nThis beautifully appointed residence offers a superb blend of comfort, style, and city-centre convenience. The property is presented in excellent condition throughout, boasting a bright and spacious interior with generously proportioned accommodation designed for modern living. \n\nThe living area is particularly impressive, flooded with natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The well-equipped kitchen is both stylish and functional, while the double bedroom provides a restful retreat. A key feature of this property is the inclusion of a secure car space—a rare and invaluable asset in such a prime city location.\n\nBachelors Walk is one of Dublin's most vibrant and sought after city centre addresses, set along the River Liffey and just moments from O'Connell Street. This prime location offers unparalleled access to an extensive array of amenities, including an eclectic mix of cafés, restaurants, bars, and retail outlets. Residents can enjoy leisurely strolls along the river, as well as convenient proximity to cultural landmarks such as the Abbey Theatre, Trinity College, and Temple Bar. The surrounding area has a dynamic and lively atmosphere, making it an ideal choice for both owner-occupiers and investors alike.\n\nConnectivity is a standout feature of this property. The apartment is exceptionally well served by public transport, with the LUAS Red Line just a short walk away, providing swift access across the city. Numerous Dublin Bus routes operate nearby, offering comprehensive coverage throughout Dublin. Tara Street and Connolly Stations are also within easy reach, giving access to DART and mainline rail services, making commuting effortless. In addition, Dublin Airport is approximately 20 minutes away by car or easily accessible via express bus services, ensuring excellent national and international connectivity.",
